; Catalog description file for Aukadicty
; This file is used to generate localized .catalog files
;
; Format: MSG_ID (text)
; where text is the default English string
;
; Use FlexCat or similar tool to compile:
;   FlexCat aukadicty.cd NEWCTFILE aukadicty.ct
;   FlexCat aukadicty.cd aukadicty.ct CATALOG locale/english/aukadicty.catalog
;
